* `references/neexp-paper/05_quantum_preliminaries.tex:1440-1477`
* `references/qpbt-paper/08_classical_and_quantum_low_degree_tests.tex:413-458`
* `blueprint/src/chapter/ch13_qpbt_test.tex:575-600`
